- The API response has this shape:
  {
    "capabilities": null,       // should be populated
    "decomposition": null,      // should be populated
    "catalog_matches": [...]    // working correctly
  }
- The frontend renders "Component Layers" and "Architecture Composition" 
  sections only when these fields are non-null.
- The root cause is suspected to be LLM model misconfiguration.

## Task
Fix the backend so that `capabilities` and `decomposition` are correctly 
populated. Make minimal, surgical changes. Do not refactor existing logic.

